From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OddBlueDog <3959851+OddBlueDog@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:26:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: tests: phones whose doze notice goes missing, and
 the hold

The power-save simulation gets phones that doze without the firmware
learning of it, the driver's own probes, and the report of each frame's
end as the tx-free event gives it. The hold of a station that stopped
answering is tested step by step (when it starts and when not, what
waits, the probes, each way out) and against the same run without it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tests/ps-sim-test.c | 551 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 538 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

